            Two things are not in the table because they vary too much by revision to state honestly: exact sharing splits and PPS ranges. Both are worth checking on the specific listing before buying, especially if you plan to charge a laptop and a Samsung phone from the same block. When a listing does not publish a sharing table, assume the laptop port drops noticeably the moment a second device is plugged in.
